
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>MYSVEX | Connect With Us</title>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#090909">

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}

:root{
  --gold:#d9bc82;
  --gold2:#f8e8c3;
  --bg:#090909;
}

body{
  min-height:100svh;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  padding:20px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 15%,#302515 0%,transparent 45%),
    var(--bg);
  color:#fff;
  font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;
}

.page{
  width:100%;
  max-width:350px;
  text-align:center;
  padding:30px 22px 22px;
  border:1px solid #443823;
  border-radius:25px;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#171510,#0d0d0d 60%);
  box-shadow:0 25px 80px #0009, inset 0 1px #ffffff0a;
  animation:enter .7s ease both;
}

.logo{
  width:68px;
  height:68px;
  margin:0 auto 15px;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  border:1px solid #bda16b;
  border-radius:50%;
  box-shadow:0 0 25px #d9bc8218;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#292217,#0c0c0c);
}

.logo span{
  font:600 27px 'Playfair Display',serif;
  letter-spacing:-3px;
  padding-right:3px;
  background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fff2cd,#c6a15b,#fff0c9);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;
  background-clip:text;
  color:transparent;
}

h1{
  font:600 34px 'Playfair Display',serif;
  letter-spacing:4px;
  padding-left:4px;
  background:linear-gradient(100deg,#fff0ca,#d9bc82,#f9e8c0);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;
  background-clip:text;
  color:transparent;
}

.tagline{
  font-size:11px;
  color:#aaa49a;
  margin:8px 0 23px;
  letter-spacing:.6px;
}

.links{
  display:grid;
  gap:10px;
}

.link{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:12px;
  min-height:58px;
  padding:10px 13px;
  text-decoration:none;
  color:#f8f5ed;
  text-align:left;
  border:1px solid #302b22;
  border-radius:13px;
  background:linear-gradient(110deg,#1c1a15,#111);
  transition:.25s ease;
}

.link:hover{
  transform:translateY(-2px);
  border-color:#c5a66d;
  background:linear-gradient(110deg,#282116,#14120e);
  box-shadow:0 6px 22px #d9bc8212;
}

.icon{
  width:35px;
  height:35px;
  flex-shrink:0;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  border:1px solid #5c4b30;
  border-radius:10px;
  color:var(--gold2);
  font-size:17px;
}

.info{flex:1}

.info b{
  display:block;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:600;
}

.info small{
  display:block;
  margin-top:3px;
  color:#8f8b83;
  font-size:10px;
}

.arrow{
  color:var(--gold);
  font-size:18px;
  transition:.25s;
}

.link:hover .arrow{transform:translate(2px,-2px)}

.note{
  margin-top:21px;
  font-size:10px;
  color:#8b8578;
  letter-spacing:.4px;
}

.note span{color:var(--gold)}

footer{
  margin-top:15px;
  padding-top:13px;
  border-top:1px solid #ffffff0c;
  font-size:9px;
  letter-spacing:1.5px;
  color:#625c50;
}

@keyframes enter{
  from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}
  to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
}

@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<main class="page">

  <div class="logo"><span>MS</span></div>

  <h1>MYSVEX</h1>
  <p class="tagline">A LITTLE LUXURY, JUST FOR YOU ✨</p>

  <nav class="links" aria-label="Social media">

    <a class="link" href="https://www.facebook.com/share/1chdZj7Mog/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span class="icon">f</span>
      <span class="info">
        <b>Facebook</b>
        <small>Discover our collection</small>
      </span>
      <span class="arrow">↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="link" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@mysvex" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span class="icon">♪</span>
      <span class="info">
        <b>TikTok</b>
        <small>Watch our latest videos</small>
      </span>
      <span class="arrow">↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="link" href="https://instagram.com/mysve_x?psln=bHFwZnhzNG9vNWFp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span class="icon">◎</span>
      <span class="info">
        <b>Instagram</b>
        <small>Style, beauty & more</small>
      </span>
      <span class="arrow">↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="link" href="https://wa.me/message/DCRDD26U56TOA1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span class="icon">✆</span>
      <span class="info">
        <b>WhatsApp</b>
        <small>Let's talk about your order</small>
      </span>
      <span class="arrow">↗</span>
    </a>

  </nav>

  <p class="note">Made with <span>♥</span> for your style</p>

  <footer>© <span id="year"></span> MYSVEX · OFFICIAL</footer>

</main>

<script>
document.getElementById('year').textContent=new Date().getFullYear();
</script>
</body>
</html>
